<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.10.5/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Merriweather&family=Poppins:wght@500&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
        integrity="sha384-LN+7fdVzj6u52u30Kp6M/trliBMCMKTyK833zpbD+pXdCLuTusPj697FH4R/5mcr" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/layout.css">
</head>

<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

    <%- include("partials/navbar.ejs") %>

        <section class="flex-grow-1">
            <div class="hero-section">
                <h1>About MKZone</h1>
                <p>Sharing ideas, knowledge, and perspectives that spark growth. Built with passion, written with
                    purpose.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-main">
                <h2>Who We Are</h2>
                <p>
                    MKZone is a professional blogging platform dedicated to insightful, inspiring, and impactful
                    content.
                    Created by <strong>Muktar Bello</strong>, this space explores topics in technology, creativity,
                    personal
                    development, and everything in between.
                </p>
                <p>
                    With a background in web development and digital communication, Muktar brings a unique blend of
                    technical
                    expertise and creative storytelling to every post.
                    MKZone is more than a website, it's a growing community for thinkers, learners, and builders.
                </p>

                <h2 class="mt-5">Our Mission</h2>
                <p>
                    To deliver valuable content that educates, empowers, and engages. We believe in clarity over
                    complexity,
                    consistency over chaos, and connection over clicks.
                </p>

                <div class="stats-box mt-5 row text-center">
                    <div class="col-md-4 stat">
                        <h3>10+</h3>
                        <p>Articles Published</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 stat">
                        <h3>200+</h3>
                        <p>Monthly Readers</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-md-4 stat">
                        <h3>10+</h3>
                        <p>Countries Reached</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <%- include("partials/footer.ejs") %>

            <script src="/js/ui.js"></script>
            <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>


</body>

</html>
